; Export forwarders so per-good-trade.dll can stand in as the game's version.dll: EU4 imports
; VERSION.dll, Windows loads the game-directory copy before the System32 one (version.dll is NOT
; a KnownDLL -- checked), so our DllMain runs before the game's main and the mod is present in
; EVERY launch, Steam's included. No injector, nothing to time.
;
; THE FORWARDER TARGET MUST NOT BE "version" (2026-08-27): the loader resolves a forwarder's
; module name by the normal search order, which finds the GAME-DIRECTORY version.dll -- us --
; and a self-referential forwarder is a load-time failure. eu4.exe then dies before its window
; appears (measured: process gone within 2 s, no log, no crash dump). install-proxy.ps1 therefore
; copies the real System32ersion.dll into the game directory as pgt_version_orig.dll, and every
; export below forwards there.
LIBRARY per-good-trade
EXPORTS
    GetFileVersionInfoA        = pgt_version_orig.GetFileVersionInfoA
    GetFileVersionInfoByHandle = pgt_version_orig.GetFileVersionInfoByHandle
    GetFileVersionInfoExW      = pgt_version_orig.GetFileVersionInfoExW
    GetFileVersionInfoSizeA    = pgt_version_orig.GetFileVersionInfoSizeA
    GetFileVersionInfoSizeExW  = pgt_version_orig.GetFileVersionInfoSizeExW
    GetFileVersionInfoSizeW    = pgt_version_orig.GetFileVersionInfoSizeW
    GetFileVersionInfoW        = pgt_version_orig.GetFileVersionInfoW
    VerFindFileA               = pgt_version_orig.VerFindFileA
    VerFindFileW               = pgt_version_orig.VerFindFileW
    VerInstallFileA            = pgt_version_orig.VerInstallFileA
    VerInstallFileW            = pgt_version_orig.VerInstallFileW
    VerLanguageNameA           = pgt_version_orig.VerLanguageNameA
    VerLanguageNameW           = pgt_version_orig.VerLanguageNameW
    VerQueryValueA             = pgt_version_orig.VerQueryValueA
    VerQueryValueW             = pgt_version_orig.VerQueryValueW
